{
  "canonical": "https://github.com/materin-tech/materin-ui",
  "contract": {
    "version": "0.1",
    "pattern": "materin-<scope>-<component>[__part][--variant]",
    "utility_pattern": "materin-u-<name>",
    "state_pattern": "is-<state>",
    "scopes": [
      "ui",
      "site",
      "docs",
      "office",
      "view",
      "ctx"
    ],
    "rules": [
      "每个组件一个名字，名字里带 scope 和用途；不用裸类名（.card / .btn）",
      "组件内部结构用 __part，变体用 --variant，状态用 is-<state> 或 ARIA 属性",
      "一个组件只有一个名字，不做别名，否则按名查找会落空",
      "组件不写死色值，只引用 --materin-* 令牌",
      "工具类不承载视觉身份，只做布局与文字处理，前缀 materin-u-",
      "i18n 类固定为 lang-zh / lang-en，不属于组件，不参与重命名"
    ]
  },
  "tokens_file": "tokens/materin-ui.css",
  "registry_rules": [
    "parts / variants 用简写：parts 写全名（父名__part），variants 只写 --variant",
    "repo 字段指向组件实现所在的仓库；本站组件在 materin-tech.github.io",
    "清单是给 tools/check-components.py 读的，不是文档：名字与实现不允许对不上",
    "Vue 组件库的条目 file 指向 .vue（其 <style> 块即组件层样式）；变体只写 --variant，部件写全名"
  ],
  "pending": {
    "note": "以下仓库尚未接入契约，数值为实测（styles.css 行数 / 类名数）",
    "repos": [
      {
        "repo": "leapord/Materin-office",
        "scope": "office",
        "styles_lines": 534,
        "class_names": 76,
        "status": "类名已是 materin-office-*；待换令牌（强调色 / 状态色 / 硬编码 #1f1f1f、#ffffff）"
      },
      {
        "repo": "leapord/Materin-view",
        "scope": "view",
        "styles_lines": 608,
        "class_names": 108,
        "status": "多数已是 materin-view-*；materin-chip、materin-doc-* 缺 scope 段，待改名为 materin-view-*"
      },
      {
        "repo": "leapord/Materin-ctx",
        "scope": "ctx",
        "styles_lines": 135,
        "class_names": 20,
        "status": "类名已是 materin-ctx-*；待把写死的 #3a7d44 / #b8860b / #c2711d 换成 --materin-ok/warn/error"
      }
    ]
  },
